{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49448","headline":"小重山 一 · 薛昭藴","name":"小重山 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春到长门春草青，玉阶华露滴，月胧明。\n东风吹断紫箫声，宫漏促，帘外晓啼鸎。\n愁极梦难成，红妆流宿泪，不胜情。\n手挼裙带遶花行，思君切，罗幌暗尘生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛昭藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}